pt?","Čekio reikia?","a5e2905b9b41",0.73],[-1,"That would be great, thanks.","Būtų puiku, ačiū.",1],[0,"Sure thing. Here's your receipt.","Žinoma. Štai Jūsų čekis.","e95af0a5b6ae",1.6],[0,"Enjoy your stay!","Malonios viešnagės!","e9f2b3f3e19b",1.13],[0,"Hi there! Hop in! Where to?","Sveiki! Lipkite! Kur važiuojame?","0b9e2a1b2d6e",1.8],[-1,"I'm going to the museum.","Vykstu į muziejų.",1],[0,"Alright, the museum. Buckle up!","Gerai, muziejus. Prisisekite!","d1aa44adf339",2.35],[0,"Would you like me to put your bag in the trunk?","Ar įdėti Jūsų krepšį į bagažinę?","a21af0e44d46",1.86],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[0,"Let's go!","Važiuojam!","25a5a021b973",0.82],[0,"About fifteen minutes, depending on traffic.","Apie 15 minučių, priklausomai nuo eismo.","9135bae2f41a",2.43],[0,"So, where are you from?","Tai iš kur Jūs?","eeb9d2b24c37",1.29],[-1,"I'm from Lithuania.","Esu iš Lietuvos.",1],[0,"Lithuania! Cool. Basketball country, right?","Lietuva! Šaunu. Krepšinio šalis, tiesa?","68053fc03185",3.26],[-1,"Yes, we love basketball!","Taip, mes dieviname krepšinį!",1],[0,"I knew it! Sabonis was amazing!","Taip ir žinojau! Sabonis buvo nuostabus!","63d166f378d4",2.68],[0,"We're here: the museum!","Atvykome – muziejus!","f3cf0dbfccc1",1.88],[0,"Where do you want me to stop?","Kur sustoti?","dd66beb2ba12",1.23],[-1,"Right here is fine.","Čia tiks.",1],[0,"Sure thing.","Žinoma.","c10240cec84d",0.89],[0,"So that's twenty-one seventy-five.","Taigi 21,75 $.","14c734c31e65",2.18],[-1,"Here you go.","Prašom.",1],[0,"Perfect, thanks!","Puiku, ačiū!","75c05ab253dc",1.36],[0,"Have a great day!","Puikios dienos!","a27d43f63b57",0.92],[0,"Hey! Where can I take you?","Sveiki! Kur Jus nuvežti?","6a44baebd565",1.59],[-1,"I'm going to Harbor Bank.","Vykstu į „Harbor“ banką.",1],[0,"Sure thing! Heading to Harbor Bank.","Žinoma! Važiuojame į „Harbor“ banką.","ee2beaf86023",2.11],[-1,"I'm from Lithuania. And you?","Esu iš Lietuvos. O Jūs?",1],[0,"Me? Born and raised right here!","Aš? Čia gi